Word lists used by Verrou's passphrase generator
================================================

Both files are embedded in the Verrou binaries at compile time
(crates/verrou-core/src/passphrase.rs) and are kept here exactly as their
authors published them. At load time Verrou keeps only the word of each line
(dropping the dice numbers), lowercases it and removes duplicates; the files
themselves are not modified.


