wordlist_fr.txt (French, 7,776 lines, 7,775 distinct words)
-----------------------------------------------------------

French diceware word list by Tango <tango.tails@proton.me> (2024), crafted
for diceware, Tails and the Tor Project, distributed with the `diceware`
program by Uli Fouquet.
Source: https://github.com/ulif/diceware/blob/master/diceware/wordlists/wordlist_fr.txt
SHA-256: 48014d49bbe0691fc82f0b6121f5e50db74b49501403571f80bd7b6e9fbbe022

Dedicated to the public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
(see the upstream COPYRIGHT file: "Files: diceware/wordlists/wordlist_fr.txt,
Copyright: 2024 Tango, License: CC0-1.0"); full text in
LICENSE-CC0-1.0.txt.

Words are plain ASCII, without accents. The list contains both "Internet"
and "internet", hence 7,775 distinct words once lowercased. Unlike the EFF
list, it is not prefix-free; this does not matter here since Verrou always
puts a separator between words.
